  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;An effective and efficient digitalized access to legal aid system is established to ensure transparent, low-cost, easily accessible services that promote legal aid, advices and services for poor, marginalized and left behind communities in Bangladesh.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
